# autotest alpha.10 batch G (lane SC2, 2026-11-24). Written against the Feature text with sha 39acd010e7d71092; honest subset only: what a screen or the guest shows is under clause, everything else under not-covered.
row: F-LOOK-05
targets: qemu
profile: ram
feature-sha: 39acd010e7d71092
doc: Settings, Appearance lists the built-in Looks (read only)
clause: 1 Settings, Appearance lists the built-in Looks Default, Compact and Classic
not-covered: .look and .theme files of the person's and the shared theme folders
not-covered: loading a Look by name
not-covered: the choice kept as look in ui-<user>.json and an old file still read
key s
wait app=Settings
skip-unless-button Appearance
click-sidebar Appearance
wait app=Settings page="Appearance"
shot page
expect-not-blank
expect-text Default
expect-text Compact
expect-text Classic
expect-page Appearance
